+# v0.28.0-alpha7 transactional rehearsal buildfix1 validation
+
+## Correction
+
+- Corrected CS1503 at `LibraryTruthWindow.xaml.cs` line 70.
+- Replaced `Task.Run(_rehearsal.GetLatestItems)` with `Task.Run(() => _rehearsal.GetLatestItems())` because `GetLatestItems` has the optional `limit` parameter.
+- Added a source-validation guard against reintroducing the invalid method-group call.
+
+## Static validation completed
+
+- Parsed all 37 project/XAML XML files successfully.
+- Confirmed `VERSION.txt`, project `Version` and `InformationalVersion` agree.
+- Confirmed the invalid method-group call is absent and the explicit lambda occurs exactly once.
+- Confirmed database schema remains 43 and Library Truth export schema remains 5.
+- Confirmed the buildfix patch applies cleanly to the original alpha7 source.
+- Confirmed no `bin`, `obj` or `.vs` directories are included.
+
+No Library Truth, adoption-preview, backup, transaction, rollback, state-preservation or live-library behaviour changed. Full compilation and smoke tests still require Windows with the .NET 8 SDK.
